I had that problem when I first started with it. Beside the poster's
name at the top of their host, click the "show options" link; a box
will appear. Click the "Reply" link in there, and you will be given the
quoted text automatically. Note, however, that it'll be laid out as if
to encourage top-posting by default, but you can quickly delete the
initial blank line and shift your cursor to the end of the textbox to
cure that.

(NB: The "Reply" link at the bottom of the post is utterly useless;
ignore it.)

Sad that we have to jump through hoops just to get a perfectly
reasonable style of behaviour out of Giggle Groups, but at least it
lets some of us read the news a bit easier.



